Correction — capex holds, prices recover                Buyers raise/hold budgets; credit spreads narrow                          ✅ All buyers guiding higher; IG OAS tight                                    
Cyclical bust — capex cut 30–40%; borrowers restructure Large buyer cuts guidance; inventories build; borrower fails to refinance ⚠️ No cuts yet; inventory rising at Nvidia and memory; no refinancing failure
